WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.421
♪♪♪
- Is Micah Parsons underrated?

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.297
Micah, are you ready?
- We’re good here.

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:07.340
- Here we go.
- Hut.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.885
- [Everyone:] Ooh!

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.053
- Hey, we tested him, man.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.806
- Nice hips, Micah.

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:26.735
♪♪♪
Welcome to Underrated.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:31.406
The only show dedicated to improving
the video game ratings of professional

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:34.367
athletes. Today, Micah Parsons.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:39.622
If God built a linebacker, it's
this kid. Penn State. Dallas Cowboys.

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:41.916
The only thing brighter
than his future is this jacket.

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:46.629
My guy Micah Parsons.
The man in real life.

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.381
But what about in Madden?

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.674
Let's go to our pro gamer,

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:50.800
YoBoy PIZZA.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.677
- Thanks a lot, Adam.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:57.182
Now, look. We got Micah Parsons, probably
the best defensive prospect

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:58.892
coming out of the entire draft.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:00:59.642
This man has

00:01:00.101 --> 00:01:01.853
skills all over the field.

00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:06.191
He’s a speedster. He has the
acceleration. But one thing I was

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:08.526
taking a look at is his man coverage.

00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:10.862
I feel like they did him a
little bit dirty with that rating.

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:16.576
- So I have some of your ratings.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.662
This is your day job. Man coverage,

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:21.206
what do you think that rating is?

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:22.916
- I’m going to go with a 75.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:24.584
- 59.
[Buzzer]

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:26.878
You want me to hold that for you?

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.505
Are you going to spike it or something?

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:30.590
- That’s made me sick to my stomach.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:37.847
Let's bring in my guy, the official
Madden ratings adjustor, Clint Oldenburg.

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.396
♪♪♪
I thought man coverage was low

00:01:46.022 --> 00:01:46.272
- Yeah.

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:46.856
- at 59.

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:47.482
- I do too.

00:01:48.149 --> 00:01:50.610
- Cuz when he was coming out,
all I heard during the draft

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.945
was he could stay with anybody.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:57.575
- Hey, you're a great athlete
undoubtedly. You’re 17th already among all

00:01:57.575 --> 00:01:58.993
middle linebackers in man coverage.

00:01:58.993 --> 00:02:02.914
You're right behind Devin White, Dont’a
Hightower, two great NFL players.

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:06.334
So you're, you’re already inside the top 20
now, but I think we can help today.

00:02:06.584 --> 00:02:06.918
- OK.

00:02:14.217 --> 00:02:16.761
♪♪♪
- How are we going to do man coverage?

00:02:17.011 --> 00:02:19.597
- I think we're going to get a little
help from one of our friends.

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:22.183
Kyle Pitts is going to
be controlling a robot for us.

00:02:23.226 --> 00:02:28.273
- He's strutting in like Ric Flair.
Styling, profiling, limousine riding.

00:02:28.606 --> 00:02:29.315
- He's going to run routes

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.025
with this robot, and
you're going to cover the robot.

00:02:31.359 --> 00:02:31.693
- OK.

00:02:35.738 --> 00:02:36.739
- [Lefkoe:] Micah, your job,

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:41.953
if you choose to accept it, is to stay
with this dummy as long as possible.

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:45.790
On my count. Three, two, one, go.

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:48.543
- [Pitts:] Oh. That’s pass interference.
[Lefkoe laughing]

00:02:49.419 --> 00:02:50.920
Come on, kid. Uh-oh. Oh.

00:02:52.422 --> 00:02:53.381
- I mean, he was all over it.

00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:56.259
- Yup, that's a flag, coach.
- That’s a flag.

00:02:56.301 --> 00:02:56.676
I don't know.

00:02:56.718 --> 00:02:57.343
That was pretty good

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:57.969
coverage.

00:02:58.261 --> 00:02:59.304
Three, two, one, go.

00:03:00.096 --> 00:03:01.347
- Go get outta here, kid.

00:03:05.935 --> 00:03:06.561
Oh! I won! That’s a completion.
[Lefkoe laughing]

00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:07.854
Quarterback gonna throw that.

00:03:08.146 --> 00:03:09.856
- He’s trying to run my foot over.
- [Pitts:] Take that man coverage down.

00:03:11.399 --> 00:03:12.233
Hey, you lost.

00:03:12.275 --> 00:03:13.067
Come on, bring it back for

00:03:13.067 --> 00:03:14.652
another rep. Beat you again.

00:03:15.653 --> 00:03:17.864
- Three, two, one, go.

00:03:20.617 --> 00:03:25.455
[Lefkoe laughing]
- C’mon, Kyle. Is that all you got?

00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:29.792
- All right, this is the last one. Three, two, one, go.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:33.838
- You lost.

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:35.340
- [Lefkoe:] I don't know.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.132
He was kind of there.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:37.634
- [Pitts:] The ball’s out.

00:03:37.759 --> 00:03:38.801
We have to be practical.

00:03:39.135 --> 00:03:41.554
- That’s inside leverage, Kyle.
You should know better.

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:46.517
- Clint, what were you able to glean
from this exercise with this guy?

00:03:46.517 --> 00:03:49.437
I did see some, some
quick feet, that athleticism

00:03:49.437 --> 00:03:50.563
that we talked about.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.065
- What was it at before?

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.191
It was at 59.

00:03:53.524 --> 00:03:54.317
- So 59.

00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:55.360
What, what are we going up to?

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.028
- You're going to get a plus two.

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.613
You're going to go up to 61.

00:03:59.197 --> 00:04:02.158
That puts you in the top 15 among all
the middle linebackers in the NFL.

00:04:02.492 --> 00:04:05.870
- Now we need to fix that
one thing: catching.

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:09.916
- We got Micah Parsons, who is
just an all-around athlete.

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:10.708
We all know that.

00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:15.046
And his hands, his catching,
showing up at a 57 rating.

00:04:15.338 --> 00:04:18.299
Look, we all know you gotta be able
to catch the ball as a linebacker.

00:04:18.299 --> 00:04:19.926
If the ball's coming to you,
you don't want to be that guy

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:21.386
that messes up.

00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:25.765
And right now with a 57 rating, I
feel like we'll be dropping balls more

00:04:25.765 --> 00:04:27.225
than he actually would in real life.

00:04:28.184 --> 00:04:29.394
- Do you have hands?

00:04:30.728 --> 00:04:33.523
- I do have hands.
- What do you think your catching rating is?

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:35.275
- I'm gonna say, like, a 75.
[Ding]

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.860
- You're catching is 57.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:39.696
[Buzzer]
- Oh, my God.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:43.491
- I can't tell if you're
laughing because you're happy.

00:04:43.491 --> 00:04:46.577
Or if you're just this shocked or—
- That's just atrocious.

00:04:47.036 --> 00:04:48.538
- Atrocious.
- Atrocious.

00:04:48.663 --> 00:04:51.124
Egregious.
- Egregious and atrocious.

00:04:53.751 --> 00:04:57.463
A linebacker with hands is a
surprisingly great part of a defense.

00:04:57.588 --> 00:04:59.340
You know what else is surprisingly great?

00:04:59.507 --> 00:05:01.301
The rates at State Farm that fit any budget.

00:05:02.677 --> 00:05:07.432
♪♪♪

00:05:07.432 --> 00:05:10.685
I want your rating to go so high
that people don't even recognize you.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.146
So what I'm going to do is I'm going
to bring in a dude with a golden arm.

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:14.397
Jordan Love.

00:05:14.439 --> 00:05:15.023
Let's bring him in.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:15.940
Wow.

00:05:16.232 --> 00:05:16.566
- Yes, sir.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.986
- Ooh. See that? That’s the future right there.

00:05:20.403 --> 00:05:20.737
OK.

00:05:20.903 --> 00:05:23.948
We're going to have you run some
classic linebacker drills, and I

00:05:23.948 --> 00:05:27.535
don't want the balls to be easy to
catch. Not because I want him to fail,

00:05:28.202 --> 00:05:30.246
but because if he makes the
big catch, what happens,

00:05:30.246 --> 00:05:31.414
Clint?
- Rating goes up.

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:32.707
- How much does it go up?

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:36.502
- I think we got a nice range of maybe
six to eight points, which is pretty big.

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:37.879
- Mm!
- Mmm!

00:05:37.879 --> 00:05:39.422
- Say it with your chest.
- On the line now.

00:05:39.422 --> 00:05:40.173
- Let's go get it!

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:41.674
- Remember, drops hurt.

00:05:41.799 --> 00:05:42.425
- That’s OK.

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:43.176
You gotta go big or

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:45.636
go home.
- Born ready.

00:05:47.096 --> 00:05:47.805
- OK, let's do this.

00:05:49.932 --> 00:05:52.310
- Here we go.
- Set hut. Let’s go.

00:05:53.811 --> 00:05:56.272
- Ah!
- OK, easy, fingertips.

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.232
Second ball.
- Set hut.

00:05:59.233 --> 00:06:00.401
- Micah drops back.

00:06:00.526 --> 00:06:02.403
Goes deep, comes in hard to the left.

00:06:03.321 --> 00:06:05.531
- [Together:] Ooh.
- He threw it—there was good zip on it.

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:09.744
- Yeah, that almost slipped through his hands there.
- Set hut.

00:06:10.119 --> 00:06:12.413
- Come on.
- [Lefkoe:] Ooh, hard done.

00:06:13.623 --> 00:06:15.291
- [Together:] Ooh!
- That's a good one. There’s a good one.

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:17.460
- Hey!
- He's staring right at you, Clint.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.419
- Hey!
- I see him.

00:06:18.961 --> 00:06:21.005
- He's staring right at Clint.
- Let him know. You see it.

00:06:22.465 --> 00:06:23.549
- What do you need more from him?

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:25.593
- Can we, can we get him to flip
his hips and see if he can

00:06:25.593 --> 00:06:26.761
make a catch over his shoulder?

00:06:26.928 --> 00:06:27.303
- OK.

00:06:27.345 --> 00:06:27.762
Going deep?

00:06:27.804 --> 00:06:28.054
- Yeah.

00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:28.388
- OK.

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:28.638
OK.

00:06:28.638 --> 00:06:28.846
Cool.

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:30.765
- All right, let’s do that on this one.
- We can do that. That’s good.

00:06:33.142 --> 00:06:38.689
- Set hut.
- [Clint:] Oh, good ball.

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:43.611
- Woo!
- Yeah, deep ball and everything.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:44.570
What, is he

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.071
4-for-4 now?

00:06:45.071 --> 00:06:47.031
- He's 4-for-4.
- [Love:] That’s no drops.

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:49.409
- Can we give him a low one?

00:06:49.492 --> 00:06:49.826
- OK.

00:06:50.201 --> 00:06:50.451
Deep, or you

00:06:50.451 --> 00:06:51.452
want him to come down here?

00:06:51.619 --> 00:06:52.078
- Either one.

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:52.620
- OK, cool.

00:06:52.662 --> 00:06:53.329
I'll bring him down here.

00:06:53.496 --> 00:06:54.122
- How we feelin’,

00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:54.539
Micah?

00:06:55.498 --> 00:06:56.290
- [Parsons:] Born ready.
- [Lefkoe:] Big time. Born ready.

00:06:56.457 --> 00:06:57.458
- [Love:] He eatin’ out here.

00:06:58.709 --> 00:06:59.127
Good.

00:06:59.502 --> 00:07:00.044
- He’s gettin’ real confident.

00:07:00.503 --> 00:07:00.878
This is what

00:07:00.878 --> 00:07:04.590
I'm a little bit worried about.
He’s dropping.

00:07:04.757 --> 00:07:05.258
He's coming in.

00:07:07.468 --> 00:07:08.177
- [Clint:] There was some bobble there.
- He threw it low and outside!

00:07:11.305 --> 00:07:13.766
- [Clint:] He caught it. He caught it.
- [Love:] We tested him, man. We tested him.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:15.518
- Impressive performance.

00:07:15.518 --> 00:07:18.896
I think the best one was when he had to
reach out for over here on the right side.

00:07:18.896 --> 00:07:19.230
- [Lefkoe:] Yeah.

00:07:19.522 --> 00:07:20.106
- [Clint:] And he caught it.

00:07:20.189 --> 00:07:20.648
- [Lefkoe:] Yes.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:21.524
- [Clint:] Yeah,

00:07:21.524 --> 00:07:24.235
so I think there's some
room to improve this rating.

00:07:25.361 --> 00:07:27.989
Micah, how much points do you think
you earned on your catch rating?

00:07:28.531 --> 00:07:30.992
- I would say between five to eight,
what I was guaranteed.

00:07:31.701 --> 00:07:34.328
- I mean, that was what was offered to him.
Yeah.

00:07:34.328 --> 00:07:37.748
- You're gonna get an increase of
eight, to your catching rating.

00:07:38.166 --> 00:07:39.500
So you're now gonna be a 65.

00:07:40.751 --> 00:07:44.797
That moves you up. This is how close it is at
the middle linebacker position.

00:07:45.381 --> 00:07:48.551
You're moving from 101st-ranked
middle linebacker

00:07:48.593 --> 00:07:50.470
all the way up into the top 35.
- [Lefkoe:] Woooo!

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:57.685
What we witnessed today was born-ready
Micah Parsons stepping

00:07:57.685 --> 00:07:59.687
up and handling his business.

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:03.524
Man coverage went up two.
Catching went up eight.

00:08:04.567 --> 00:08:07.445
And so, Clint, I really have one
simple question that I want you

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:11.365
to look right into his face and
answer: Is Micah Parsons underrated?

00:08:12.116 --> 00:08:12.325
- Yeah.

00:08:12.325 --> 00:08:14.911
Coming into today, we had
Micah Parsons underrated.

00:08:15.536 --> 00:08:18.372
You fixed some of those concerns we
talked about from catching in college.

00:08:18.581 --> 00:08:19.415
Congratulations.
- Thank you, Clint.

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:22.960
I think that's what life’s all about, baby.

